    "def": "If \\(\\widehat\\gamma_n=1\\), set \\(\\widehat V_n=J_{\\widehat\\chi_n}(\\widehat\\zeta_n)\\widehat\\Omega_nJ_{\\widehat\\chi_n}(\\widehat\\zeta_n)^{\\top}\\); if \\(\\widehat\\gamma_n=0\\), set \\(\\widehat V_n=I_2\\).",
